    "description": "<p>You swipe your leg with enough force to create a localized shockwave strong enough to bludgeon creatures and objects in range while also blowing them away.</p>\n<p>Creatures and objects in a 30-foot cone originating from you must make a Strength saving throw, being knocked up 30 feet into the air on a failed save. An airborne creature cannot take a reaction to jutsu you cast with the Finisher keyword before the end of the current turn.</p>",
